      "writtenOn": "2025-04-29T22:55:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t match the devicetree setting:\n```\n        flash0: flash@20000400 {\n                reg \u003d \u003c 0x20000400 0x4fc00 \u003e;\n        };\n```\n\nLooks like you have Zephyr configured to load the image starting at 0x20000400, and the available size is 319 KB.\n\n319 KB is okay because the flash is 1 MB.  The EC image must be smaller than 1/2 the total flash and smaller than the code RAM.",
